{"4560130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Still Warm", "steam_appid": 4560130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Warm</strong> is a slow burn cooking simulator with light horror and a murder mystery, set in a small lángos takeaway shop in Budapest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the morning shift for a week, making food, serving the regulars, and getting to know them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then they start disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/6341a4ef2259ce7d595c4b5e29e33444.webp?t=1784673163\" width=371 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open at 5 AM. Knead the dough, fry it fresh, and serve it hot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top it, wrap it, pass it through the shutter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People come in half-awake, already knowing what they want. Sometimes they also ask for a drink, something hot, something sweet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the phone rings. You take the order, prepare it, and have it ready when Lajos, the delivery guy, shows up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/3b08093da30849856a675ab1a6b5926f.poster.avif?t=1784673163\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/3b08093da30849856a675ab1a6b5926f.webm?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/3b08093da30849856a675ab1a6b5926f.mp4?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/ba688786da7d5098653af3a34e4bd950.webp?t=1784673163\" width=371 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the regulars doesn't show up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The paper mentions a body. Then another. The regulars grow quiet and start watching each other more closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radio talks about someone on the run. You start getting strange calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/49d1ca8f767f0042cb9af5e4b6f37b0a.poster.avif?t=1784673163\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/49d1ca8f767f0042cb9af5e4b6f37b0a.webm?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/49d1ca8f767f0042cb9af5e4b6f37b0a.mp4?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/c58ea5a6a682eb79d2b29cb0d7f53a7e.webp?t=1784673163\" width=371 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook lángos from scratch: knead, fry, top, and serve it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the routines and preferences of a small cast of regulars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, focused story (around 2–3 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy setting that slowly turns uneasy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A week of early mornings where something isn't right</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/80b6811a65659e9b6792179b9cf36654.poster.avif?t=1784673163\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/80b6811a65659e9b6792179b9cf36654.webm?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/80b6811a65659e9b6792179b9cf36654.mp4?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Warm</strong> is a slow burn cooking simulator with light horror and a murder mystery, set in a small lángos takeaway shop in Budapest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the morning shift for a week, making food, serving the regulars, and getting to know them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then they start disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/6341a4ef2259ce7d595c4b5e29e33444.webp?t=1784673163\" width=371 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open at 5 AM. Knead the dough, fry it fresh, and serve it hot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top it, wrap it, pass it through the shutter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People come in half-awake, already knowing what they want. Sometimes they also ask for a drink, something hot, something sweet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the phone rings. You take the order, prepare it, and have it ready when Lajos, the delivery guy, shows up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/3b08093da30849856a675ab1a6b5926f.poster.avif?t=1784673163\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/3b08093da30849856a675ab1a6b5926f.webm?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/3b08093da30849856a675ab1a6b5926f.mp4?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/ba688786da7d5098653af3a34e4bd950.webp?t=1784673163\" width=371 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the regulars doesn't show up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The paper mentions a body. Then another. The regulars grow quiet and start watching each other more closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radio talks about someone on the run. You start getting strange calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/49d1ca8f767f0042cb9af5e4b6f37b0a.poster.avif?t=1784673163\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/49d1ca8f767f0042cb9af5e4b6f37b0a.webm?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/49d1ca8f767f0042cb9af5e4b6f37b0a.mp4?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/c58ea5a6a682eb79d2b29cb0d7f53a7e.webp?t=1784673163\" width=371 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook lángos from scratch: knead, fry, top, and serve it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the routines and preferences of a small cast of regulars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, focused story (around 2–3 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy setting that slowly turns uneasy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A week of early mornings where something isn't right</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/80b6811a65659e9b6792179b9cf36654.poster.avif?t=1784673163\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/80b6811a65659e9b6792179b9cf36654.webm?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/extras/80b6811a65659e9b6792179b9cf36654.mp4?t=1784673163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Deep-fry lángos in a Budapest alleyway and serve the regulars from the apartment building across the courtyard while they slowly realize someone is picking them off, one by one.", "supported_languages": "English, Hungarian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/ea94968e4c57e36b3df9c973569c946175109019/header.jpg?t=1784673163", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/2f46b9a3f88229f21f2db2f1c4feeec3be1a100f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784673163", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560130/2f46b9a3f88229f21f2db2f1c4feeec3be1a100f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784673163", "website": "https://stillwarmgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</str